Running `?element_text()` will pull up the help page for element_text(). You'll see that it says:

hjust

Horizontal justification (in [0, 1])

Suggesting you shouldn't expect a character string to work for horizontally justifying any element text objects. Other things do use "left" etc etc for justifying, true. Just not this one!

